"10% хоҳад буд"

#. [pages.OperationalData.percentageOfDaysWithServiceInterruptionDescription]
#. defaultMessage is:
#. The percentage of "device-days" that were statused as "down for repair", excluding weekends. For example, 20 weekdays in the month and 5 devices would equate 100 "device-days". If one device was down half of the month, this number would be 10%. A device has a service interruption when it is flagged as "Down for repair" for it maintenance status.
#: extracted_strings.json
msgid ""
"The percentage of \"device-days\" that were statused as \"down for repair\", "
"excluding weekends. For example, 20 weekdays in the month and 5 devices "
"would equate 100 \"device-days\". If one device was down half of the month, "
"this number would be 10%. A device has a service interruption when it is "
"flagged as \"Down for repair\" for it maintenance status."
msgstr ""
"Фоизи \"рӯзҳои дастгоҳ\", ба истиснои рӯзҳои истироҳат, ҳамчун \"ба таъмир "
"тамом шудааст\". Масалан, 20 рӯзи корӣ дар як моҳ ва 5 дастгоҳ ба 100 \"рӯзи "
"дастгоҳ\" баробар мешаванд. Агар як дастгоҳ нимаи моҳ коҳиш ёбад, ин рақам "
"10% хоҳад буд. Дастгоҳ қатъи хидматро дорад, вақте ки он барои ҳолати "
"нигоҳдории он ҳамчун \"Ба таъмир поён\" ишора карда мешавад."

